flowchart TD
    %% Send side
    ATTACH([User attaches a file to a message]) --> PICK[GUI picks the file · platform chooser]
    PICK --> COPY[Core copies it into app-internal storage<br>hash → fileId · per-file key · classify]
    COPY --> MSG[Publish message with attachment references<br>notification only — no key, no chunk params]
    COPY --> FAN[Send fans out: one transfer per device of the account]
    MSG --> FAN
    FAN --> CLASS{file class}

    CLASS -- "small (≤ smallFileMaxBytes)" --> MARKER[OFFER marker per device · direct link first<br>sealed half: fileId + key, ratchet-encrypted]
    CLASS -- "large (no upper bound)" --> SESS{WebRTC session open?}
    SESS -- no --> WAIT[Engine waits · never Tor · never relays]
    WAIT --> SESS
    SESS -- yes --> STREAM[Stream AEAD chunks on a per-transfer data channel<br>channel flow control · checkpoint resume]

    MARKER -- "ACK (accepted)" --> CHUNKS[Chunk rows in the outbox · windowed<br>chunk ACK = decrypted + durably staged]
    MARKER -- "DECLINED (relay full)" --> NEXTRELAY[Next relay or re-offer later]
    MARKER -- "DECLINED (target)" --> DEAD([send to that device terminally DECLINED])
    CHUNKS -- "all ACKed" --> PUSHED((push complete))
    CHUNKS -- "stall / link break" --> REM[Remainder = suffix after the<br>highest contiguous ACKed prefix]
    REM --> DEPOSIT[Deposit once per transfer · identical set<br>at every relay RelaySelectionPolicy returns]
    DEPOSIT --> ADM{Admission against<br>the storage pledge}
    ADM -- accepted --> HOLD
    ADM -- DECLINED --> OUT([that relay is out · one jump<br>the sender never chases])
    HOLD["Store ciphertext chunks in the relay store<br>PK (transferId, chunkIndex) · signature verified<br>dead transferId or out-of-range index → DECLINED at the door"]
    HOLD --> WHOLE{Whole covered suffix?}
    WHOLE -- no --> TTL[Reservation TTL cleans up<br>never pushed, never offered]
    WHOLE -- yes --> FOFFER[OFFER marker to the target<br>stored OFFER payload replayed verbatim]
    FOFFER -- ACK --> FWD[Forward chunks from the store<br>per-chunk ACKs delete rows]
    FOFFER -- "DECLINED (no space)" --> DROP([relay drops the transfer · quota freed])
    FWD --> DRAINED((transfer row dropped when drained))

    STREAM -- "coverage complete" --> PUSHED

    %% Teardown
    PUSHED --> TEARDOWN[Receiver READY → COMPLETE to every live transfer author<br>each resolves its transfer and cancels its deposits]
    TEARDOWN --> DONE([transfer COMPLETED])

    %% Pull path
    MSG -. "synced / processed by any device" .-> TRIG
    TRIG{Message references a fileId · no complete local file ·<br>no progressing transfer · grace period} -- yes --> REQ[REQUEST · one candidate at a time<br>sender devices, then own-account siblings<br>ACK → waiting for the OFFER · DECLINED → next candidate]
    REQ -- "OFFER (fresh transferId · carries the key)" --> SERVE[Holder serves the suffix from the floor-aligned<br>boundary below the requester's lowest missing byte]
    REQ -- "all DECLINED / expired" --> UNAV([file unavailable · re-openable])
    SERVE --> MERGE[Receiver merges into fileId-scoped byte coverage<br>verify hash → READY → COMPLETE to live authors]
    FWD -. delivered .-> MERGE
    STREAM -. delivered .-> MERGE
    CHUNKS -. delivered .-> MERGE
    MERGE -. "prefix stalls for fileStallTimeout" .-> TRIG
